From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 13:32:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] cli: support module-scoped local Node pools

Parse and preserve required module-scoped Node pool declarations through bundling and deployment metadata. Keep the declaration attached to the entry module, reject invalid or ambiguous combinations, and include dedicated-pool modules in Node bundle telemetry.

Add --force-node-cutover to deployment and preview flows, negotiate cutover protocol version 1 before sending it, and warn that interrupted actions may have completed external effects. Keep dry runs and internal development pushes non-forced, and report committed cutover failure explicitly.
